WEBVTT

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.510
Let’s begin.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.160
I'll face you!

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.860
Playmaker!

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:14.340
You came.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:18.540
Playmaker, it’s really you?

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.330
The real version?

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.130
I...  I...

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.340
Leave this to me.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:24.170
Huh?

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:25.920
Okay!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.040
Here.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:37.740
Umm...  This card is too much for 
me, so I’ll give it back for now.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:44.920
But in a future duel, if you 
believe I can carry on your will-

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:48.170
So you’re the Another's final mastermind.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:53.320
What an elaborate plan.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:57.060
Stealing my card data and 
giving it to Brave Max.

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:58.490
What?

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:00.850
Stole your card data?

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:02.370
What are you talking about?

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:03.820
What?

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.080
If it wasn’t you, then who-

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:08.620
Hey, Playmaker.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:10.590
That doesn’t matter.

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:12.700
Let’s just go.

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:15.590
He's not the type who'd admit the truth.

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:19.340
I only have one goal.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:23.300
To defeat you and acquire the Ignis.

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:28.540
Playmaker!  I’ll prepare a 
stage fitting for your last duel!

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.070
Activate Data Gale!

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:42.670
It's the same as Go Onizuka and Blue Angel.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.700
We’re trapped.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:49.510
We can’t go home unless we beat him.

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:51.730
Playmaker, follow me!

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:00.830
Speed Duel!

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:19.730
I run Across the universe

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:22.900
At the speed of light

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.770
Begin Loading

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:28.510
Open the door of dreams

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:32.080
VRAINS spreads

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:35.180
Believe in myself

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:38.720
VRAINS continues

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:44.030
The circuit draws the future

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:48.100
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:49.700
Access!

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:52.400
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:54.000
I'm now With the Wind

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:56.300
Link with my soul

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:59.070
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:00.810
Now Win the Race

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:03.650
Connected world

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:07.150
No matter when

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:10.520
Nothing is impossible

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:14.660
Strive for hope

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:19.230
And ride the wind!

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:38.020
I'll go first.  My turn!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:42.370
From my hand, I activate the 
Continuous Spell, Wormhole Defense!

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:51.630
What’s that?

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:57.820
Something huge has appeared!

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:01.950
But it’s hard to see.

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:05.390
And there’s no broadcast right now.

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:08.830
Hmm…  I know!

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:12.780
I almost forgot I equipped this 
because I knew this might happen.

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.450
Max Eye!

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.030
I can see clearly!

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:22.040
When Wormhole Defense activates...

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:27.850
...I can Special Summon a Motor 
Worm Token in defense position.

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:36.600
From my hand, I activate the 
spell card, Motor Worm Bait!

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:40.620
I Special Summon two Motor Worm 
Tokens in defense position!

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:48.570
Three Motor Worm Tokens on his field…

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:51.010
He's going all out from the start!

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:54.510
Appear!  Our future circuit!

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:59.880
The summoning conditions 
are at least two Insects!

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:03.460
I set three Motor Worm Tokens.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.360
Link Summon!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:13.000
Come out, Link 3 Motor Worm Spreader Queen!

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:20.810
Motor Worm Spreader Queen’s 
effect activates!

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:25.070
Once per turn, when there are 
no monsters next to her link...

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:30.650
...I can Special Summon a Motor 
Worm Token next to her link.

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:35.900
Spreader Queen’s additional effect!

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:42.150
This card gains 700 ATK for every 
Insect monster on the field!

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:44.740
There are two Insects on the field.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:47.460
So she gains 1400 ATK!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:51.540
She creates children to strengthen herself.

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:53.200
She truly is an insect queen.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:56.220
She stopped at 2400 ATK.

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:58.680
Playmaker'll handle this easily!

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:01.320
My preparations are complete.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:04.820
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:11.060
Hold on, Shima!

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:15.420
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:18.020
When there are no monsters on my field...

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:21.360
...I can Special Summon 
Linkslayer from my hand!

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:28.420
When there’s a Cyberse on my field...

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:31.670
...I can Special Summon 
this card from my hand!

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:34.320
Come, Backup Secretary!

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:39.260
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:43.680
The summoning conditions are two monsters!

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:48.980
I set Linkslayer and Backup 
Secretary in the Link Markers!

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:52.990
Link Summon!

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:56.720
Appear, Link 2 Space Insulator!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:02.070
From my hand, I Special 
Summon Link Infra-Flier!

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:08.080
I can Special Summon it next 
to a Link Monster's link.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:13.010
Appear again!  The circuit 
that leads to the future!

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:17.560
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Effect Monsters.

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:21.730
I set Link Infra-Flier and 
Link 2 Space Insulator!

00:07:24.930 --> 00:07:26.060
Link Summon!

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:29.830
Appear, Link 3 Decode Talker!

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:37.040
Then I summon Cyberse Wizard!

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:45.480
Due to Decode Talker’s effect, it gains 
500 ATK for every monster next to its links.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.210
Power Integration!

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:54.630
All right!  It now has more 
ATK than Spreader Queen!

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.060
I tricked you.

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:58.690
I set one card.

00:07:58.690 --> 00:07:59.790
Battle!

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:03.270
Decode Talker attacks Spreader Queen!

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:05.470
Decode End!

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:07.740
Wormhole Defense’s effect!

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:13.570
When a battle or an effect will 
destroy this card or an Insect...

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:16.980
...a Motor Worm Token is 
destroyed in its place!

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:24.780
Spreader Queen isn’t destroyed.

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:27.030
But you still take damage.

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:35.740
Since a Motor Worm Token was destroyed, 
Spreader Queen loses 700 ATK!

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:39.600
Next, Cyberse Wizard attacks Spreader Queen!

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:41.760
Illusion Spike!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.210
Bye, queen!

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:51.710
I activate the trap card, Worm Revival!

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:56.480
I Special Summon a Link 3 or lower 
Insect Link Monster from my graveyard!

00:08:56.480 --> 00:09:00.400
Resurrect, Motor Worm Spreader Queen!

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:03.560
Oh my.  She already returned.

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:06.070
Seems you knew I'd destroy her.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:09.510
Due to Worm Revival’s additional effect...

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:13.960
...I Special Summon a Motor 
Worm Token next to her link.

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:20.440
As long as Spreader Queen is on the field, 
you can’t attack Motor Worm Token.

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:28.180
Since there are two Insects on the 
field, Spreader Queen gains 1400 ATK!

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:30.410
The stage is set.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:34.940
Playmaker and Ignis, this 
is just the beginning!

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:38.060
I activate the Continuous Trap, Egg Clutch!

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:46.600
One of your monsters loses its effects, 
switches to defense position, and changes to Insect-Type!

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.240
What?

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:51.940
I use this on Cyberse Wizard!

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:03.120
Cyberse Wizard has turned into an Insect!

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:09.120
As long as Egg Clutch is on the field, 
Cyberse Wizard can’t change battle position.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:15.600
With another Insect, Spreader 
Queen gains 700 ATK.

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.330
This is bad!

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:20.530
It now has more ATK than Decode Talker!

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:22.710
Is there nothing we can do?

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:24.840
I end my turn.

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:27.450
There's really nothing we can do?

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:33.450
It's over for you, Playmaker.

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:41.060
My turn!

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:43.420
Egg Clutch’s effect activates.

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:48.880
Once during each of our turns, 
I can tribute my Insect...

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:54.450
...to Special Summon two Motor Worm Tokens 
in defense position on your field!

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:58.910
I tribute Motor Worm Token!

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:09.170
Umm…  One fewer Motor Worm 
Token, but then add two...

00:11:09.170 --> 00:11:12.880
The queen gains 700 ATK.

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:15.530
Spreader Queen’s additional effect!

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:19.640
I Special Summon a Motor Worm Token!

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:25.200
Spreader Queen gains 700 ATK!

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:27.410
This is bad!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:28.740
I’m not done.

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:32.870
From my hand, I activate the 
Continuous Spell, Motor Worm Gate!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:41.350
When all your monsters are Insects, an 
Insect on my field can attack you directly.

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:44.350
Wait, mister.

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:48.840
Since Decode Talker is on our field, 
you can’t attack us directly-

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:50.060
Battle!

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:53.540
Spreader Queen attacks Decode Talker!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:08.400
Our field is nothing but bugs!

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:10.850
I will defeat you.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:13.380
And acquire the Ignis.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:20.110
For the two who fell short, I will win!

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:23.890
I activate my Skill, Double Bite!

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:27.260
A Skill?

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:33.500
Once during the duel, my 
Insect can attack twice!

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:34.470
What?

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:36.950
Go, Spreader Queen!

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:41.140
Due to Motor Worm Gate, she 
can attack you directly!

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:46.080
Huh?  The attack vanished.

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:50.480
What?  Where?

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:55.950
It’s coming closer!

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:57.180
Below!

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:03.800
It’s over, Playmaker and Ignis!

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:07.730
I activate the trap card, Urgent Link!

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:11.200
Battle damage is halved!

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:17.550
Playmaker!

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.200
50 LP left.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.280
You’re barely alive.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.460
But it's enough to fight with.

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:30.220
Let's go!

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:31.760
Hey!  Don't run yet!

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:40.900
Urgent Link’s additional effect!

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:45.370
After the battle, I can 
Link Summon a Cyberse!

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:50.380
We use Motor Worm Token to 
Link Summon Link Spider!

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:53.680
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:55.860
What?

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.850
Huh?  Why won't the Token go?

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:01.320
Due to Wormhole Defense’s effect...

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:06.560
...you can’t tribute 
Insects to Link Summon.

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:09.800
Bugs bug me!

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:15.270
Too bad.  You have no future!

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:18.270
What will you do, Playmaker?

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:21.240
The match isn’t over yet.

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:27.220
Playmaker was one of the victims.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:31.170
We created those victims.

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:36.090
And that led to the creation 
of the detestable Ignis.

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:41.150
I'll bear this burden 
for the rest of my life.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:45.670
But I can’t get sentimental right now.

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:49.880
On the next turn, I'll defeat 
you and acquire the Ignis!

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:52.110
I end my turn!

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:56.180
I can see it.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.660
There's still a way.

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:02.580
My turn!

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:06.660
My Spreader Queen combo is invincible!

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:08.550
Give up!

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:14.200
From my hand, I activate the 
Quick-Play Spell, Cybersal Cyclone!

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:21.510
By banishing a monster from my graveyard 
whose Link is equal to your Link Monster's Link...

00:15:21.510 --> 00:15:23.770
...your monster is destroyed!

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:26.240
Spreader Queen is Link 3.

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:30.520
So I banish Link 3 Decode 
Talker from my graveyard!

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:33.130
Spreader Queen is destroyed!

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:36.220
Queen!  Goodbye for real this time!

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:37.980
That won't work.

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:40.180
Wormhole Defense’s effect!

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:47.100
By destroying a Motor Worm Token in 
her place, she isn’t destroyed!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.580
I was waiting for this moment.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:52.540
What?

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:55.270
Cybersal Cyclone’s additional effect!

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:58.740
If the banished monster is a Cyberse...

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:02.810
...one card in your Spell & 
Trap Card Zone is destroyed!

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:08.020
I destroy Wormhole Defense!

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:13.180
All right!  Wormhole is gone!

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:16.430
It wasn’t invincible.

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:17.450
It's not over!

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.630
Spreader Queen’s effect activates!

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:23.100
I Special Summon a Motor Worm Token.

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:28.070
Spreader Queen gains 700 ATK!

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:32.700
I won’t lose just because Wormhole is gone!

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:33.840
Are you sure?

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.280
Go!

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:44.620
I see.  His Skill.

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:45.780
Here I go!

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:06.110
Now!  Seize the wind, Playmaker!

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:10.120
Activating Skill!  Storm Access!

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.860
Here I go for real, Faust!

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:21.010
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:23.920
Arrowheads confirmed!

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:26.480
The summoning conditions are three monsters!

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:32.600
I set two Motor Worm Tokens and 
Cyberse Wizard in the Link Markers!

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:34.200
Circuit combine!

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:35.670
Link Summon!

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:40.340
Appear, Link 3 Powercode Talker!

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:49.750
It’s a new Link Monster!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:56.930
Since there are three fewer Insects on 
the field, Spreader Queen loses 2100 ATK!

00:17:57.240 --> 00:18:01.060
But Spreader Queen still has greater ATK!

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:04.060
Space Insulator's effect from the graveyard!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:09.800
When I Link Summon a Cyberse Link 
Monster, it Special Summons itself!

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:12.370
Come, Space Insulator!

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:15.580
Powercode Talker’s effect activates!

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:21.520
Once per turn, one monster's effects 
are negated until the end of the turn.

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:28.540
Wire Restruction!

00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:35.830
The next strike will end you, Faust!

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.180
Listen to me, Playmaker!

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:42.130
That Ignis...  Humanity’s future-

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:46.000
Playmaker!  Let’s finish him.

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:48.750
Battle!

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:52.820
Powercode Talker attacks 
Motor Worm Spreader Queen!

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:56.380
Powercode Talker’s additional effect!

00:18:56.380 --> 00:19:02.930
I tribute Space Insulator that's next to its 
link to double Powercode Talker’s ATK!

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:04.160
Break through!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.590
Power Termination Smash!

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:16.510
Playmaker!

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:21.310
Due to your actions, 
humanity’s future will be-

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:29.930
Humanity’s future?

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:32.260
What did he mean?

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:36.250
Who knows.  Ai don’t know.

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:42.000
Playmaker, I’m very sorry for today.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:45.940
Since I bragged about Cyberse Wizard…

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:49.860
I’m not worthy of carrying 
on Playmaker’s will.

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:52.050
Do you have the courage to keep going?

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:56.660
Create your own path by yourself.

00:19:57.470 --> 00:19:59.980
No matter how difficult the path…

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:07.150
Create my own path...

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:15.530
Shima!

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.480
Are you okay?

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:21.100
Fujiki!  You came to save me?

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:21.970
No.

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:24.510
Was there anyone else here?

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:27.510
No, just me.

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:37.650
Anyway, guess who saved me?

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:39.540
Playmaker!

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:42.820
And Playmaker is carrying on my will.

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:44.400
Isn’t that incredible?

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:48.190
The restraints were made 
to release automatically.

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:53.800
That means Faust had no intention 
of turning Shima into Another.

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:59.050
It's like...  It’s like 
we’re on the same page.

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:03.130
Our hearts are united on a deep level.

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:04.140
We might form a team...

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:06.440
He talks a lot.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:12.620
Someone used Shima to lure me out.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:15.620
The one who sent Cyberse 
Wizard is the culprit.

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:20.030
If it isn't Faust, the one who can is...

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:23.680
It can’t be…

00:21:37.070 --> 00:21:39.710
The Hanoi purged her?

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:42.670
She knew this would happen 
if she released the program.

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:45.020
But she accepted the consequences.

00:21:45.020 --> 00:21:47.480
Huh?  What do you mean?

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:49.660
She felt guilty.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.690
Felt guilty?

00:21:51.690 --> 00:21:53.800
You don’t need to understand.

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:55.530
I’ll call an ambulance.

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:15.710
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:22.850
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:23.270 --> 00:22:30.050
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:37.430
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:38.280 --> 00:22:44.670
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:45.060 --> 00:22:48.800
There were fragments of power

00:22:49.060 --> 00:22:55.980
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:03.320
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:10.530
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:17.730
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:24.610
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:32.310
Lighting Life with our invisible bond

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:39.260
We've abandoned everything to get this far.

00:23:39.260 --> 00:23:44.860
With no regrets, we're ready and haven't 
misjudged our enemy's strength.

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:50.430
We're firmly determined, 
but we still feel anxious.

00:23:50.430 --> 00:23:57.180
We may be worrying too much, but we 
anticipate the worst and record all our actions.

00:23:57.180 --> 00:24:00.160
We must sense when Revolver 
will make his move.

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:03.530
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Kusanagi Report

00:24:03.530 --> 00:24:05.390
Into the VRAINS!
